msgid "Sticky Account"
msgstr ""

#: data/admin.php:205
msgid "An account icon, e.g. in the header. When it scrolls out of view, a floating account button appears; both open a panel with the account menu, or a login form for guests. Stacks next to the Sticky Cart button instead of covering it."
msgstr ""

#: data/admin.php:206 data/pro-presets.php:1918 data/pro-presets.php:1928 data/pro-presets.php:1938 data/pro-presets.php:1948
msgid "Sticky Wishlist"
msgstr ""

#: data/admin.php:206
msgid "A wishlist icon with the count, e.g. in the header. When it scrolls out of view, a floating button appears; both open a drawer with the saved products. With it on the page, the product images in lists get a heart. Builds on the free Wishlist blocks. Stacks next to the Sticky Cart and Sticky Account buttons."
msgstr ""

#: data/admin.php:210
msgid "Wishlist, compare and product page"
msgstr ""

#: data/admin.php:213 data/pro-presets.php:414
msgid "Compare Button"
msgstr ""

#: data/admin.php:213
msgid "A Compare button for the product page or a product template: the product goes to the compare bar, and the visitor compares up to four products side by side."
msgstr ""

#: data/admin.php:214
msgid "Compare Icon"
msgstr ""

#: data/admin.php:214
msgid "A compare icon with the number of products in the comparison, e.g. in the header. A click opens the comparison window. With it on the page, the product images in lists get compare buttons."
msgstr ""

#: data/admin.php:215
msgid "Comparison Table"
msgstr ""

#: data/admin.php:215
msgid "A product comparison table: chosen products with price, rating, availability, attributes and Add to cart, one of them highlighted – or the visitor's own comparison on a Compare page."
