msgid "Checkout Steps"
msgstr ""

#: data/admin.php:222
msgid "The WooCommerce checkout in steps – details, shipping, payment – with a progress bar, Continue and Back buttons and a summary of the finished steps. For the Checkout block and the classic checkout."
msgstr ""

#: data/admin.php:223 data/pro-presets.php:2358 data/pro-presets.php:2368 data/pro-presets.php:2378 data/pro-presets.php:2388 data/pro-presets.php:2398
msgid "Popups"
msgstr ""

#: data/admin.php:223
msgid "Popups with any blocks – a window, a slide-in, a bar or the full screen – after some seconds, after scrolling, when leaving, after adding to the cart or with a link. Site-wide popups with rules for pages, visitors and how often."
msgstr ""

