msgid "The product with 1–4 products that go with it, check boxes, the total price and one \"Add all to cart\" button."
msgstr ""

#: data/admin.php:226
msgid "Cart Recommendations"
msgstr ""

#: data/admin.php:226
msgid "Products to add from the side cart with one click: the cross-sells of the cart, best sellers, products on sale or the newest – a list, a scrolling row or two columns. For side cart layouts."
msgstr ""

