msgid "Volume Pricing"
msgstr ""

#: data/admin.php:227
msgid "Quantity discounts (\"3+ pieces: 10 % off\") set on the product, shown in a table where a click sets the quantity; the cart charges the lower price."
msgstr ""

#: data/admin.php:228 data/pro-presets.php:2677 data/pro-presets.php:2687 data/pro-presets.php:2697 data/pro-presets.php:2707 includes/class-envo-blocks-admin.php:397
