msgstr ""

#: data/admin.php:229 data/pro-presets.php:2717 data/pro-presets.php:2727 data/pro-presets.php:2737 data/pro-presets.php:2747
msgid "Deals & Offers"
msgstr ""

#: data/admin.php:229
msgid "Discount rules that run your promotions – buy 2 get 1 free, a free gift, a percent off a category, an amount off big orders, with dates and days – and a block that shows the running deals and what is missing."
msgstr ""

#: data/admin.php:230
msgid "Quote Request"
msgstr ""

#: data/admin.php:230
msgid "Request a quote for catalog products: a quote list with quantities and a form; the request becomes an order you answer with prices and a payment link."
msgstr ""

#: data/admin.php:231
msgid "Price History Chart"
msgstr ""

