msgid "The price of a product in the last 30–365 days as a chart, with the current, lowest and highest price, from the real price history; follows the chosen variation."
msgstr ""

#: data/admin.php:232
msgid "Price Alert"
msgstr ""

#: data/admin.php:232
msgid "\"Notify me when the price drops\": visitors leave their e-mail and get one e-mail when the price of the product or the chosen variation goes down."
msgstr ""

#: data/admin.php:233 data/pro-presets.php:2597 data/pro-presets.php:2607 data/pro-presets.php:2617 data/pro-presets.php:2627 includes/class-envo-blocks-admin.php:397
