msgstr ""

#: data/admin.php:233
msgid "\"Notify me when it is available\": on a product that is out of stock visitors leave their e-mail and get one e-mail when it is in stock again – also for the chosen variation, with a list of the most wanted products."
msgstr ""

#: data/admin.php:234 data/pro-presets.php:2834 data/pro-presets.php:2844 data/pro-presets.php:2854 data/pro-presets.php:2864 includes/class-envo-blocks-admin.php:397
